# Response Structure
- in src/handlers/* , mainHandler should not return APIGatewayProxyResult structure response.
- in src/handlers/* , mainHandler can return with anything.
- [requestHandler.ts](mdc:src/utils/requestHandler.ts) should handle the returned information from mainHandler to structure for APIGatewayProxyResult
- Prefer not to use try catch, we will try to handle error in parent call using .catch() from promise response.
- InputSchema should come below the handler function
- add inputschema only when there is any need.
